N1Mem Public Repository — License & Boundary Notice
===================================================

This repository (the "Public Repo") contains T1Mem's BENCHMARK EVIDENCE and
REPRODUCIBILITY package (BYOK). It is NOT the T1Mem product source code.

1. OPEN-SOURCE CONTENTS (licensed under the MIT License below)
   - Evaluation / scoring scripts (judge, official F1, aggregation)
   - Frozen result artifacts (answers + scores), SHA256-signed
   - Reproduction guides, configuration templates, documentation
   - Architecture design documents (descriptions only, NO source code)

2. PROPRIETARY CONTENTS (NOT in this repo, NOT licensed here)
   The T1Mem CORE ENGINE is a closed-source commercial / patent asset and is
   explicitly EXCLUDED from this repository. It includes, without limitation:
   - Five-dimensional memory model and time-axis architecture
   - Structured Fact Extraction (SFE) and OR aggregation
   - Multi-model Reader (Qwen / GLM / DeepSeek + ensemble)
   - Retrieval engine internals (BGE-M3 + BM25 + RRF + temporal)
   These run ONLY inside the T1Mem core, invoked as a black box.

3. EXTERNAL BENCHMARKS
   MemoryAgentBench (ICLR'26) and LoCoMo (snap-research) are third-party
   works; their respective licenses apply to their own datasets/code.

